===Etymology 2===
{{compound|en|hash|bang}} or {{compound|en|sharp|bang}}, after Etymology 1.

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|computing}} The [[character]] [[string]] "{{monospace|#!}}" used at the beginning of a [[computer]] [[file]] to indicate which [[interpreter]] can process the [[command]]s in the file, chiefly used in [[Unix]] and related [[operating system]]s.

